# estante CODEOWNERS — pleme-io maintainers own every path by default.
#
# Lives at the repo root so GitHub's CODEOWNERS resolver picks it up
# regardless of branch-protection profile. Used by GitHub to:
#   1. Auto-assign reviewers on PR open.
#   2. Enforce the "1 review from a CODEOWNER" rule under :standard
#      branch protection (pangea-architectures OpenSourceRepo profile).
#
# Per-path overrides go beneath the global rule, last-match-wins.

*                                  @pleme-io/maintainers

# Substrate-touching changes need a substrate review on top of
# whoever else touches the area.
flake.nix                          @pleme-io/maintainers @pleme-io/substrate
Cargo.toml                         @pleme-io/maintainers @pleme-io/substrate
rust-toolchain.toml                @pleme-io/maintainers @pleme-io/substrate
caixa.lisp                         @pleme-io/maintainers @pleme-io/substrate
